        <mxCell id="trzXZjU4LcE_3F4M6dTc-12" edge="1" parent="1" source="trzXZjU4LcE_3F4M6dTc-7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;curved=1;rounded=0;curveGeometry=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;defaultLabelBackgroundColor=page;dashed=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=0;" target="trzXZjU4LcE_3F4M6dTc-9">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" x="0.002" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="trzXZjU4LcE_3F4M6dTc-7" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;dashed=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;&quot;&gt;Uma determinada sequência de chunks permite reconstruir um arquivo específico do backup. A estrutura de diretórios e as informações necessárias para reconstruir os arquivos, incluindo suas respectivas sequências de chunks, são armazenadas em &lt;font style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(99, 99, 99)); font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;/trees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="115" width="237" x="294.99999999999994" y="686.56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ORBiBSXEMkMT2L4BPP3Z-10" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;file1.ext&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="10" width="32.89" x="270.11" y="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ORBiBSXEMkMT2L4BPP3Z-11" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 10px; padding-left: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;Lorem Ipsum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt; is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="320" x="270.11" y="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="trzXZjU4LcE_3F4M6dTc-25" edge="1" parent="1" source="trzXZjU4LcE_3F4M6dTc-13" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;curved=1;rounded=0;curveGeometry=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;defaultLabelBackgroundColor=page;dashed=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=0;" target="trzXZjU4LcE_3F4M6dTc-20">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" x="0.0097" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="trzXZjU4LcE_3F4M6dTc-13" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;dashed=1;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; padding-right: 10px; padding-left: 10px;&quot;&gt;Uma determinada estrutura de diretórios (Tree) representa o estado completo de um projeto em um momento específico. As informações referentes a esse estado, como a identificação da Tree, a data de criação e a referência ao Snapshot anterior, são armazenadas em &lt;strong&gt;/snapshots&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="310.11" x="243" y="920" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="trzXZjU4LcE_3F4M6dTc-31" edge="1" parent="1" source="trzXZjU4LcE_3F4M6dTc-14" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;curved=1;rounded=0;curveGeometry=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;defaultLabelBackgroundColor=page;dashed=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=0;" target="trzXZjU4LcE_3F4M6dTc-28">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" x="0.0021" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="trzXZjU4LcE_3F4M6dTc-14" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;dashed=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify; padding-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;Uma Branch representa uma linha de desenvolvimento do projeto, mantendo uma referência para o Snapshot mais recente dessa linha. As referências para os Snapshots de cada Branch são armazenadas em &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;/branches&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="299.39" x="190" y="1060" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
